            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "charlottesmom"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this dish to go along with a turkey dinner we had tonight. I mixed it up last night (except the corn flakes...I added those in right before I baked it) to save time today. I followed the recipe exactly except, I was cooking for only 4 people, so I halved the recipe and put it in an 11x7 casserole dish instead of a ring mold. Everyone loved it! It was very tasty and a nice change from the same ole, same ole. The only thing I would recommend is to run the carrots through a food processor instead of a mixer. Much easier and quicker that way. Otherwise, it was very easy. Thanks for sharing this recipe! I'll be making it again for Thanksgiving."
          },
